<div id="__nuxt"><div><main id="main-content" class="default-layout__main"><!--[--><div data-page="[subpath1]/[uid].vue"><div class="outer-container"><div><!--[--><div id="export-to-the-usa-from-the-uk-with-evri" class="international-hero-banner international-hero-banner--horizontal" index="0" data-v-3b1a9605><div class="international-hero-banner__container international-hero-banner__container--horizontal" data-v-3b1a9605><div class="international-hero-banner__left international-hero-banner__left--horizontal" data-v-3b1a9605><!----><h1 class="international-hero-banner__left-header-title international-hero-banner__left-header-title--horizontal" data-v-3b1a9605>Export to the USA from the UK with Evri</h1><span class="international-hero-banner__left-header-text international-hero-banner__left-header-text--horizontal" data-v-3b1a9605></span></div><div class="international-hero-banner__right international-hero-banner__right--horizontal" data-v-3b1a9605><div class="e-card-wrapper form-card form-card--horizontal-widget international-hero-banner__right-card" data-v-3b1a9605 data-v-7963b653 data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--thin-padding e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><!--[--><div class="send-entry__loading" data-v-7963b653><svg data-test-id="e-spinner" class="e-spinner e-spinner--brand-01" width="32" height="32" viewbox="0 0 200 200" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-v-7963b653 data-v-1340f2af><title data-v-1340f2af>loading spinner</title><circle class="circle-1" cx="100" cy="100" r="90" fill="none" stroke-width="20" data-v-1340f2af></circle><circle class="circle-2" cx="100" cy="100" r="90" fill="none" stroke-width="20" stroke-dasharray="140, 500" stroke-linecap="round" data-v-1340f2af></circle></svg></div><!--]--><!--]--></div><div class="e-card__footer" data-test-id="card-footer" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><span data-v-7963b653></span><!--]--></div></div><!----></div></div></div></div><section id="expand-your-uk-business-by-exporting-to-the-usa" class="section-wrapper" index="1" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--no-cta" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/68f64c0d-a14e-4525-bde9-5fc335e3d188_1000x670px_USAa942.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/68f64c0d-a14e-4525-bde9-5fc335e3d188_1000x670px_USA.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/68f64c0d-a14e-4525-bde9-5fc335e3d188_1000x670px_USA.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/68f64c0d-a14e-4525-bde9-5fc335e3d188_1000x670px_USA.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Skyline photo of New York City, USA featuring the Empire State Building" width="1000" height="670" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Expand your UK business by exporting to the USA</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->It should come as no surprise that the USA is the UK’s biggest trade partner. E-commerce is no exception, with technology and lifestyle industries making up for massive volumes of parcels travelling overseas through our network. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->For large and small businesses alike, breaking into the US market could present an ocean of opportunity to grow your user base or diversify your product to meet the needs of a titan of world trade. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->As a courier that assists thousands of businesses across the UK in achieving their shipping goals, allow us to walk you through everything you need to consider when exporting goods to the USA.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="section-wrapper" class="section-wrapper wrapper" index="2" data-v-85d73ac7 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><div data-v-85d73ac7><div data-v-85d73ac7 data-v-90dc4169><div id="selling-to-the-usa-on-an-online-marketplace" class="photo-list__text-container" data-v-90dc4169><h2 class="photo-list__title" data-v-90dc4169>Selling to the USA on an online marketplace</h2><p class="photo-list__desc" data-v-90dc4169>An online marketplace is a platform for buyers and sellers, offering handy features to allow businesses to sell with minimal barriers to entry. This ease-of-use extends naturally into selling overseas, so you can utilise these platforms in your journey to exporting goods to the USA.</p></div><!--[--><div class="link-block__item" data-v-90dc4169 data-v-805cf62b><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z3wUvJbqstJ99FvA_Smallbusinessowneronlaptop89c2.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z3wUvJbqstJ99FvA_Smallbusinessowneronlaptop.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C6%2C7008%2C4660&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z3wUvJbqstJ99FvA_Smallbusinessowneronlaptop.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C6%2C7008%2C4660&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z3wUvJbqstJ99FvA_Smallbusinessowneronlaptop.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C6%2C7008%2C4660&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt width="1000" height="665" class="link-block__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-805cf62b><div class="link-block__text-container" data-v-805cf62b><h3 class="link-block__card-title" data-v-805cf62b><!----> Amazon</h3><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Gain instant access to millions of online customers with the world’s leading digital marketplace. Set up an entire digital storefront with Amazon’s amazing seller tools to elevate your e-commerce platform. You can gain quick access to the US market through Amazon by creating a North America and Brazil unified account. Find out more about how to sell on Amazon in 2025. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="link-block__item" data-v-90dc4169 data-v-805cf62b><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2Vh6pbqstJ98usb_Packagingshoesa3df.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2Vh6pbqstJ98usb_Packagingshoes.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C0%2C6015%2C4000&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2Vh6pbqstJ98usb_Packagingshoes.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C0%2C6015%2C4000&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2Vh6pbqstJ98usb_Packagingshoes.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C0%2C6015%2C4000&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt width="1000" height="665" class="link-block__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-805cf62b><div class="link-block__text-container" data-v-805cf62b><h3 class="link-block__card-title" data-v-805cf62b><!----> eBay</h3><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Providing businesses and individuals with the tools to sell in a wide variety of markets, eBay has always been a pioneer of online marketplaces. Allowing businesses to further their reach overseas was always the natural next step, and eBay couldn’t have made it easier for its users. Whether you’re totally new to eBay and are just setting up an account, or you’ve been selling for years, all you need to do is offer international shipping on your product, and the channel is officially open. Discover more on <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/our-services/ebay-integration" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->how to sell on eBay in 2025<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> for more.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="link-block__item" data-v-90dc4169 data-v-805cf62b><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2VhdpbqstJ98usN_Packaginggift-1-8333.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2VhdpbqstJ98usN_Packaginggift-1-.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C4%2C5000%2C3325&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2VhdpbqstJ98usN_Packaginggift-1-.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C4%2C5000%2C3325&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2VhdpbqstJ98usN_Packaginggift-1-.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C4%2C5000%2C3325&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Customer wrapping a gift parcel" width="1000" height="665" class="link-block__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-805cf62b><div class="link-block__text-container" data-v-805cf62b><h3 class="link-block__card-title" data-v-805cf62b><!----> Etsy</h3><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->For small businesses and independent creatives and entrepreneurs, Etsy proudly advertise the heart that goes into making a product, allowing their sellers access to dozens of niche audiences with a taste for quality. When you register to sell on Etsy, you can use their handy shipping profiles to decide which countries you want to be able to send to, as well as customise the postage rates for each once you’ve managed to calculate your shipping costs. Learn more about <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/our-services/etsy-integration" class=""><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->how to sell on Etsy in 2025<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> with our guide.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="how-to-get-started-exporting-to-the-usa-independently" class="section-wrapper" index="3" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--no-image" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><!----><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>How to get started exporting to the USA independently</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->It’s first important to ensure that your product listing complies with US consumer standards. Think about the sizes and dimensions of your product, because the USA not only favours imperial measurements, but they also have totally different standard clothing and shoe sizes. Present the details of your product thoroughly and account for regional differences.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Now you’ve refined your product, and you’ve made a sale, where do you go from there? <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->A smart <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/fulfilment-services" class=""><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->global fulfilment service<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> could be your ideal solution for exporting products to the USA. At Evri, we have two strategically placed <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/explore-our-global-fulfilment-centres" class=""><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->US fulfilment hubs<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> that carry a wide variety of products and offer extensive value-added services. Easily manage peak period demand, cost pressures, and scalability when breaking into this new market with Evri global fulfilment. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--icon e-button--link card__button" data-gtm-track="button-Find out more about global fuliflment" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/fulfilment-services" data-v-e1e30b9c style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><div class="e-button__icon" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_right" data-test-id="chevron_right" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron right</title> <g> <path d="M12.6 12L8.7 8.1C8.52 7.92 8.42 7.68 8.42 7.4C8.42 7.12 8.52 6.88 8.7 6.7C8.88 6.52 9.12 6.42 9.4 6.42C9.68 6.42 9.92 6.52 10.1 6.7L14.7 11.3C14.8 11.4 14.87 11.51 14.91 11.62C14.95 11.74 14.97 11.87 14.97 12C14.97 12.13 14.95 12.26 14.91 12.38C14.87 12.49 14.8 12.6 14.7 12.7L10.1 17.3C9.92 17.48 9.68 17.57 9.4 17.57C9.12 17.57 8.88 17.48 8.7 17.3C8.52 17.12 8.42 16.88 8.42 16.6C8.42 16.32 8.52 16.08 8.7 15.9L12.6 12Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div><!--]--></div><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--> Find out more about global fuliflment<!--]--></span></a><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="section-wrapper" class="section-wrapper wrapper" index="4" data-v-85d73ac7 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><div data-v-85d73ac7><div data-v-85d73ac7 data-v-5d43a0fc><div id="opportunities-for-growth-in-the-usa-market" class="list-block__text-container" data-v-5d43a0fc><h2 class="list-block__title" data-v-5d43a0fc>Opportunities for growth in the USA market</h2><p class="list-block__desc" data-v-5d43a0fc>When exploring the idea of exporting goods to the USA, it’s important to consider your business and whether the potential for growth is strong enough to justify the investment. Thankfully, in the modern world, there is more opportunity than ever before. Open to a vast selection of products and services, our courier service can support your businesses in delivering to new markets across the globe. Here are just a few opportunities in the USA with great potential that you should consider:</p></div><!--[--><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/310e5f30-345e-45c1-a5cb-91a5eceee8ae_What%27s+in+the+box.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="Clothes in a box icon" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Fashion</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->The culturally rich population of the United States is evident, and its fashion industry is representative of that. Introduction of a bespoke and innovative clothing brand into the United States market could offer massive growth potential, especially when you consider the strength of its current viral marketing and influencer culture. This is not to mention the lightweight and space-efficient nature of <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/how-to-sell-clothes-online" class=""><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->shipping clothes<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->, making for a relatively low-cost venture into a thriving market.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/d7cc2443-0047-4998-a550-fabf5e0f598a_phone.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="Phone icon" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Technology</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->New gadgets and tech are being dreamed into reality all over the world, and there are few countries as receptive to this as the United States. With products like Apple’s flagship iPhone dropping a reported 10% in sales at the start of 2024, it’s clear that innovations in the tech market are being sought after by a wider and wider demographic. Many tech devices and accessories are lightweight and securely packaged, offering a solid contender for that break into the USA that you might be looking for.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/0b60c675-436d-4ca1-8857-2bfbff3cb847_followed_instructions.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="Followed instructions icon" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Books</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Literature is a timeless market, with independent authors and publishers being celebrated all over the world. Publishing intelligence service BookScan reported upwards of 767 million books sold in the United States in 2023, indicating a clear desire to preserve the physical medium in the consumer habits of Americans. <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/how-to-package-books" class=""><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Books are easy to package<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> and incredibly safe during transit, equating to a low-cost and high-reward venture into the USA market.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="customs-on-goods-entering-the-usa" class="section-wrapper" index="5" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--no-cta" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2VIYZbqstJ98uap_EvriInternationalCourierServices524d.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2VIYZbqstJ98uap_EvriInternationalCourierServices.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C6016%2C4001&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2VIYZbqstJ98uap_EvriInternationalCourierServices.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C6016%2C4001&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2VIYZbqstJ98uap_EvriInternationalCourierServices.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C6016%2C4001&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt width="1000" height="665" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Customs on goods entering the USA</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Due in part to the volume of products being imported in the USA every day, the customs process is actually rather straightforward. Forms have been streamlined over the years, and processes refined to the point where the HS number of your product is the only piece of information you might not have to hand. This can be easily searched online, or when you <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->ship with Evri<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->, simply describe your item, and we will provide the HS number.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->When you’re shipping in large quantities, the last thing you want to worry about is being overloaded with paperwork. When you ship with Evri, we handle all of the documentation for you. Simply follow the instructions during the booking process by entering your details accurately, and you’re all sorted.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="choose-evri-as-your-shipping-solution-for-exporting-to-the-usa" class="landing-feature-banner landing-feature-banner--standard" data-slice-type="landing_feature_banner" data-slice-variation="fullWidthBanner" data-v-54256dfc><div class="landing-feature-banner__container" data-v-54256dfc><div class="landing-feature-banner__image-container" data-v-54256dfc><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2V6iZbqstJ98vBF_20220725-EVRI-PeoplePhotography-167ee7b.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2V6iZbqstJ98vBF_20220725-EVRI-PeoplePhotography-167.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C5%2C6240%2C4150&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2V6iZbqstJ98vBF_20220725-EVRI-PeoplePhotography-167.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C5%2C6240%2C4150&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2V6iZbqstJ98vBF_20220725-EVRI-PeoplePhotography-167.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C5%2C6240%2C4150&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt width="1000" height="665" class="landing-feature-banner__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-54256dfc></div><div class="landing-feature-banner__content--standard landing-feature-banner__content" data-v-54256dfc><!----><!----><h2 class="landing-feature-banner__title" data-v-54256dfc>Choose Evri as your shipping solution for exporting to the USA</h2><div class="landing-feature-banner__rich-text landing-feature-banner__rich-text--standard landing-feature-banner__rich-text--padding" data-v-54256dfc><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Whether for small businesses or large enterprises, Evri has a wealth of experience delivering shipping solutions for exporting to the USA at affordable prices. We’re incredibly highly rated as well, with <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/evri-reviews" class=""><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->glowing testimonials<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> and a 4.1/5 on Trustpilot from senders all across the UK.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->If you’re a small business looking to make your mark on the US market, then ship with Evri to enjoy low prices, customs made easy, end-to-end tracking and more. Get started by<!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/international-send" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->sending a parcel today<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Sending more than 150 parcels a week? You could be eligible for a business account, which grants you access to discounted prices, regular van deliveries and a dedicated customer support line to give you a great courier experience. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><div class="landing-feature-banner__button-wrapper" data-v-54256dfc><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-primary e-button--variant-3 e-bu